#
# Construct family: class disjointness / unsatisfiable class.
# A subclasses two disjoint classes B and C, so A is provably empty (unsat).
# No individual -> the ontology is CONSISTENT but A is UNSATISFIABLE.
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix ex:   <https://gmeow.example/dl/disjoint-subclass#> .

ex: a owl:Ontology .

ex:A a owl:Class .
ex:B a owl:Class .
ex:C a owl:Class .

ex:B owl:disjointWith ex:C .
ex:A rdfs:subClassOf ex:B , ex:C .
